<main>
  <!-- Card 1: Choose a Recipe -->
  <section class="card no-print">
    <h1 class="page-title">Water Kefir Flavor Recipe Builder</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      Select any of the 60 recipes below. The fermentation jar (3 cups) and bottle size (16 oz) stay fixed. Each recipe has its own separate, pre-calibrated ingredient amounts and step-by-step instructions.
    </p>

    <div class="grid">
